# 【中文注释】阅读副本：原版与原SHA保留；依赖源码哈希/AST抽取的驱动应执行验证过的原版。
# 【中文注释】顺序：先看常量/配置 → 关键函数 → 顶层或main入口 → 异常与清理。
# 【中文注释】历史版本能力按函数体/所属阶段判定，不能把新增守卫倒写到旧版。
"""Lab agent: automatically acquire a bound one-use peer-off capability."""
from __future__ import print_function
# 发布版保留assert身份/准入守卫，拒绝-O/-OO以免移除这些条件。
if not __debug__:
    raise RuntimeError('Optimized Python disables safety guards; refused')
import getopt,json,os,socket,ssl,stat,sys,uuid,urllib2

ROOT='/etc/codex-storage-power-channel'
PINS={
 'stor-svc-01':('{{LOCAL_NODE1_UUID}}','{{LOCAL_NODE1_MAC}}'),
 'stor-svc-02':('{{LOCAL_NODE2_UUID}}','{{LOCAL_NODE2_MAC}}')}
# 【中文注释】多行资料/远程代码模板；字符串保持原样。代码型片段另见旁边的远程片段解读。
META='''<resource-agent name="fence_workstation_lab" shortdesc="Workstation lab authenticated peer off">
<longdesc>Automatically acquire a session-bound one-use peer-off capability. Success requires explicit native off confirmations. No on or reboot support.</longdesc>
<vendor-url>https://developer.broadcom.com/xapis/vmware-workstation-pro-api/</vendor-url>
<parameters>
<parameter name="action" unique="0" required="0"><getopt mixed="-o, --action=[action]"/><content type="string" default="status"/><shortdesc lang="en">Power action</shortdesc></parameter>
<parameter name="port" unique="1" required="0"><getopt mixed="-n, --plug=[node]"/><content type="string"/><shortdesc lang="en">Pinned storage node</shortdesc></parameter>
<parameter name="request_id" unique="0" required="0"><getopt mixed="--request-id=[hex]"/><content type="string"/><shortdesc lang="en">Optional request ID for replay diagnostics</shortdesc></parameter>
</parameters>
<actions><action name="off" timeout="180"/><action name="status" timeout="30"/><action name="monitor" timeout="60"/><action name="list" timeout="60"/><action name="metadata"/><action name="validate-all"/></actions>
</resource-agent>'''


# 【中文注释】函数 credential：读取root私有配置并核对调用者、URL和证书，创建验证TLS的客户端上下文。
def credential():
    # 【中文注释】身份/路径/权限守卫：只允许本轮授权对象，阻止链接、替换或跨目录操作。
    assert not os.path.islink(ROOT) and os.stat(ROOT).st_uid==0
    # 【中文注释】身份/路径/权限守卫：只允许本轮授权对象，阻止链接、替换或跨目录操作。
    assert stat.S_IMODE(os.stat(ROOT).st_mode)==0700
    path=ROOT+'/credential.json'
    # 【中文注释】身份/路径/权限守卫：只允许本轮授权对象，阻止链接、替换或跨目录操作。
    assert not os.path.islink(path) and os.stat(path).st_uid==0
    # 【中文注释】身份/路径/权限守卫：只允许本轮授权对象，阻止链接、替换或跨目录操作。
    assert stat.S_IMODE(os.stat(path).st_mode)==0600
    c=json.load(open(path))
    assert c['caller']==socket.gethostname() and c['caller'] in PINS
    assert c['url']=='https://localhost:9447/v1/power'
    assert isinstance(c['bearer'],basestring) and len(c['bearer'])==64
    cert=ROOT+'/channel-cert.pem'
    # 【中文注释】身份/路径/权限守卫：只允许本轮授权对象，阻止链接、替换或跨目录操作。
    assert not os.path.islink(cert) and os.stat(cert).st_uid==0
    return c,ssl.create_default_context(cafile=cert)


# 【中文注释】函数 request：发送本轮带nonce的认证请求，并核对响应的目标、身份和平台来源。
def request(target,c,context,action='status',nonce=None,permit=None):
    assert target in PINS
    nonce=nonce or uuid.uuid4().hex
    body={'action':action,'node':target,'nonce':nonce}
    if permit is not None:body['permit']=permit
    req=urllib2.Request(c['url'],json.dumps(body),{'Content-Type':'application/json',
        'X-Storage-Caller':c['caller'],'Authorization':'Bearer '+c['bearer']})
    response=urllib2.urlopen(req,timeout=110 if action=='off' else 35,context=context)
    assert response.getcode()==200
    data=json.load(response)
    assert data['node']==target and data['nonce']==nonce and data['off_policy']=='automatic_peer_challenge'
    assert (data['bios_uuid'],data['mac'])==PINS[target]
    assert data['source']=='native_vmcli_power_query'
    assert data['power_state'] in ('on','off','paused','suspended')
    return data


# 【中文注释】函数 status：查询本次目标的明确平台电源状态并校验身份；查询失败/未知/paused不算成功off。
def status(target,c,context):return request(target,c,context)['power_state']


# 【中文注释】函数 main：程序入口：解析参数/标准输入并按分支执行；导入安全性仍取决于模块顶层代码。
def main():
    options={}
    if sys.argv[1:]:
        parsed,extra=getopt.getopt(sys.argv[1:],'o:n:', ['action=','plug=','request-id='])
        assert not extra
        for key,value in parsed:options['action' if key in ('-o','--action') else 'request_id' if key=='--request-id' else 'port']=value
    else:
        text=sys.stdin.read(8193);assert len(text)<=8192
        for line in text.splitlines():
            if not line or line.lstrip().startswith('#'):continue
            key,value=line.split('=',1);options[key.strip()]=value
    action=options.get('action','status').lower()
    if action=='metadata':print(META);return 0
    if action not in ('off','status','monitor','list','validate-all'):
        raise ValueError('Unsupported power action')
    c,context=credential()
    if action=='validate-all':return 0
    if action=='off':
        target=options.get('port',options.get('nodename',''));assert target!=c['caller']
        nonce=options.get('request_id') or uuid.uuid4().hex
        admission=request(target,c,context,'prepare_off',nonce)
        assert admission['operation']=='prepare_off'
        data=request(target,c,context,'off',nonce,admission['permit'])
        assert data['power_state']=='off' and data['operation']=='off'
        assert data['confirmation_states'][-2:]==['off','off']
        assert status(target,c,context)=='off' and status(target,c,context)=='off'
        print('native_off_verified')
        return 0
    if action=='status':
        state=status(options.get('port',options.get('nodename','')),c,context)
        return 0 if state=='on' else 2 if state=='off' else 1
    for node in sorted(PINS):
        status(node,c,context)
        if action=='list':print(node+','+node)
    return 0


# 【中文注释】脚本执行入口；只有本分支受main判断保护，前面的顶层语句仍可能在导入时执行。
if __name__=='__main__':
    try:result=main()
    # 【中文注释】保留并处理这一类失败；是否重试/记录/返回非零由本分支定义，不应直接算成功。
    except Exception:
        sys.stderr.write('Lab agent request failed; details withheld.\n');result=1
    sys.exit(result)
